- **Bidirectional Charging:** V2G technology allows electric vehicles to not only draw energy from the grid but also return energy back to it. This capability can help mitigate peak demand and provide an additional revenue stream for EV owners. Companies like "Nuvve" and "GIVENS," along with various utilities, are testing V2G systems that facilitate energy exchange between EVs and the grid.

